[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2764712045","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104811#issuecomment-2764712045","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104811","id":2764712045,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kyiht","user":{"login":"scgm0","id":52148221,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMTQ4MjIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52148221?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0","html_url":"https://github.com/scgm0","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-30T19:34:05Z","updated_at":"2025-03-30T19:34:05Z","body":"Strangely enough, I discovered that there was once a `disable_navigation` compilation option, but it appears to have been removed in some update. I only found traces of it in previously used compilation scripts and in `godot/editor/editor_build_profile.cpp`.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2764712045/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2767437029","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104811#issuecomment-2767437029","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104811","id":2767437029,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6k87zl","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-31T21:26:23Z","updated_at":"2025-03-31T21:26:23Z","body":"Did some builds to compare sizes for different combinations.\r\nNotably #101504 enabled building 2D-only export templates with `disable_3d`, as there is now a dedicated 2D navigation server, which this builds upon. This enables a new `disable_3d=yes` + keep 2D navigation combination which wasn't possible before.\r\n\r\nThe baseline for these tests is the `master` branch as of e585e6a3eb35a73aae34786fc18b0824d4050428. Both the test revert of #101504 and merge of this PR were done on that commit. All builds are optimized Linux release templates with `scons target=template_release production=yes`.\r\n\r\n| Branch | Size | Difference to `master` |\r\n|--|--|--|\r\n|`master`| 68.01 MiB | 0 |\r\n|#101504 reverted| 67.87 MiB |-156 KiB |\r\n|This PR, no options| 68.01 MiB | -4 KiB |\r\n|This PR, disabled 2D nav| 67.39 MiB | -636 KiB |\r\n|This PR, disabled 3D nav| 67.33 MiB | -696 KiB |\r\n|This PR, disabled 2D and 3D nav| 66.64 MiB | -1.37 MiB |\r\n|This PR, disabled all 3D (incl. 3D nav, but keeping 2D nav) | 56.33 MiB | -11.68 MiB |\r\n|`master`, disabled all 3D (incl. 2D and 3D nav) | 56.44 MiB | -11.57 MiB |\r\n\r\nIn summary:\r\n- #101504 actually added +156 KiB to the build, which isn't great\r\n- This PR on the other hand makes it possible to remove an extra 1.37 MiB from projects that don't need navigation\r\n- This PR enables a use case that wasn't possible before: building 2D-only export templates with navigation. This type of build removes 11.68 MiB from the binary (17%)","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2767437029/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2767445550","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104811#issuecomment-2767445550","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104811","id":2767445550,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6k894u","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-31T21:29:58Z","updated_at":"2025-03-31T21:29:58Z","body":"> Strangely enough, I discovered that there was once a `disable_navigation` compilation option, but it appears to have been removed in some update. I only found traces of it in previously used compilation scripts and in `godot/editor/editor_build_profile.cpp`.\r\n\r\nIt was never implemented actually. It was added in the build profile as something we'd want to implement eventually... this PR is that implementation, a couple of years down the road :upside_down_face: ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2767445550/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2771004391","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104811#issuecomment-2771004391","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104811","id":2771004391,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lKivn","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/user